  "about": "Round 1102: the men the rating curve is measured on, straight from the value table, with no name and no club name. One inner list is one club, in the order of the table's club string; one triple is one man: [his value rating (the value curve alone), his age on 1 August of the row's season, his matches in that season as the table had them]. scripts/simCmRatingShape.mjs section 3 asks whether reading the value rating with the age puts a club's men in an order nearer to who was actually played.",
